[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-PLAN-WP-06
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Complete elaboration namespaces, hierarchy and interface connections
STATEMENT: >>>
Multi-file same-source designs preserve shadowing, distinct parameter overrides, generated scope names and port conversion; supported parsing alone never counts as executable capability.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Inferred planning acceptance for WP-06, P1, relative scope XL. Open (unconnected) output instance ports are now accepted during UHDM flattening in native/uhdm/rtl_flatten.h; broader port forms (selected/unpacked/inout), interfaces, modports and multi-file namespace qualification remain open. Dependencies: WP-01, WP-20. Existing product IDs: VS-RTL-HIER-001, VS-RTL-PARAM-001. GitHub issue: https://github.com/jeffadickson/VeloSim/issues/7. Detailed scope, tasks, evidence limits and status index are in the linked planning documents. Library evaluation: LIB-01, LIB-06, LIB-19.
<<<
