[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-PLAN-WP-07
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Broaden expressions, numeric types and packed word sizes
STATEMENT: >>>
Independent BigInteger/bit-string oracles and multiple frontends cover widths255/256/257/512/1024, X/Z, signed overflow and casts; ABI changes are versioned and old hosts fail clearly.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Inferred planning acceptance for WP-07, P1, relative scope L. Vertical slices implemented and verified under VS-RTL-WIDE512-001 (opt-in 512-bit packed words via RtlDesignLimits.Large / --large-design / VSRTL_MAX_WORD_BITS=512 / VELOSIM_LARGE_DESIGN=1, preserving 256-bit default), VS-RTL-WILDCARD-001 (multi-label case, casez/casex, ==?/!=? and inside set/range membership across C++/C#/Rust + guarded UHDM), and VS-RTL-BITQUERY-001 ($bits, $clog2, $countones, $onehot, $onehot0, $isunknown across C++/C#/Rust + UHDM). Arbitrary >512-bit widths, streaming/assignment-pattern/cast operators and real/string types remain open. Dependencies: WP-01. Product IDs: VS-RTL-WORD-256-001, VS-RTL-WIDE512-001, VS-RTL-WILDCARD-001, VS-RTL-BITQUERY-001, VS-RTL-INTEGER-001, VS-RTL-TYPE-001. GitHub issue: https://github.com/jeffadickson/VeloSim/issues/8. Library evaluation: LIB-02, LIB-03, LIB-05, LIB-15.
<<<
