[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-PLAN-WP-10
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Implement HDL system tasks, strings, real values and file I/O
STATEMENT: >>>
Self-checking HDL programs execute and fail with exact status/source diagnostics; file malformed/missing/error cases and time-format rounding are tested independently.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Inferred planning acceptance for WP-10, P1, relative scope L. Vertical slices implemented and verified under VS-RTL-SYSTASK-001 ($readmemh/$readmemb, formatted display, finish and fatal with exitCode/rollback across C++/C#/Rust + UHDM) and VS-RTL-PLUSARGS-RNG-001 ($test$plusargs, $value$plusargs, $urandom, $urandom_range and IEEE 1364 $random LCG with deterministic seeding across C++/C#/Rust + UHDM + vpi_get_vlog_info). General file I/O ($fopen/$fscanf), strings, real values, $dist_* and $readmemh UHDM lowering remain open. Dependencies: WP-03, WP-07. Product IDs: VS-RTL-PROC-001, VS-RTL-TYPE-001, VS-RTL-SYSTASK-001, VS-RTL-PLUSARGS-RNG-001. GitHub issue: https://github.com/jeffadickson/VeloSim/issues/11. Library evaluation: LIB-02, LIB-10.
<<<
