[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-PLAN-WP-11
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Add resolved nets, inouts, primitives and force/release
STATEMENT: >>>
Independent resolution tables exercise Z, conflicting drivers, force/release and hierarchy; do not use mostly-two-state Verilator as the sole resolution oracle.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Inferred planning acceptance for WP-11, P1, relative scope XL. Vertical slices implemented and verified under VS-RTL-FORCE-001 (runtime signal force/release across C++, C# and safe Rust models with zero fast-path eval() overhead when unused) and VS-RTL-RESOLVED-001 (IEEE 1800 Tables 6-1/6-2/6-3 multi-driver net resolution for wire/tri/wand/triand/wor/trior/tri0/tri1 across C++ W/W64/W2, C# and safe Rust). UHDM force/release and inout port lowering, digital primitives/UDPs and delayed continuous assignments remain open. Dependencies: WP-02, WP-04, WP-06. Product IDs: VS-RTL-HIER-001, VS-RTL-TIME-001, VS-RTL-FORCE-001, VS-RTL-RESOLVED-001. GitHub issue: https://github.com/jeffadickson/VeloSim/issues/12. Library evaluation: LIB-17, LIB-19.
<<<
