[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-PLAN-WP-12
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Provide SystemVerilog DPI-C import and export
STATEMENT: >>>
The same small C host and HDL DPI fixtures compile against both tools for the declared subset, exercise imports and exports, and reject unsupported signatures clearly.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Inferred planning acceptance for WP-12, P1, relative scope L. Vertical slice implemented and verified under VS-RTL-DPI-001: IEEE 1800 Annex I svdpi.h header (svBit/svLogic/svBitVecVal/svLogicVecVal, bit-select helpers, svGetScope/svSetScope/svGetNameFromScope/svGetScopeFromName) bundled in C++ SDK exports and dpi_call C import statements across W, W64 and W2 C++ models (rejected fail-closed on C#/Rust). UHDM DPI import/export declaration lowering, DPI exports, open arrays and inout/output parameter marshaling remain open. Dependencies: WP-05, WP-06, WP-07. Product IDs: VS-RTL-DPI-001. GitHub issue: https://github.com/jeffadickson/VeloSim/issues/13. Library evaluation: LIB-16.
<<<
