[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-PLAN-WP-15
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Collect coverage of simulated HDL designs
STATEMENT: >>>
A tiny DUT produces independently predicted counts across merged runs; reports identify excluded constructs, reset semantics and source hashes. Simulator C# coverage is never reported as DUT coverage.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Inferred planning acceptance for WP-15, P1, relative scope L. Vertical slices implemented and verified under VS-RTL-COVERAGE-001 (opt-in rtl-export --coverage branch/case/bit-toggle instrumentation + fail-closed coverage-merge) and VS-RTL-FUNC-COV-001 (functional covergroups with explicit/range/default/ignore_bins/illegal_bins + 2-way crosses and SVA property stats serialized into velosim.dut.coverage.v1 JSON and merged fail-closed via RtlCoverageMerge). Source-line coordinates, UHDM covergroup lowering and transition bins remain open. Dependencies: WP-14. Product IDs: VS-QUAL-001, VS-RTL-COVERAGE-001, VS-RTL-FUNC-COV-001. GitHub issue: https://github.com/jeffadickson/VeloSim/issues/16. Library evaluation: LIB-18.
<<<
